#   fetching_1 - Fetch::Fetching: the HTTP cache partitions, fetch, and populating a request
#   from its client
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibWeb/Fetch/Fetching/Fetching.cpp (lines 75-381): HTTPCache (one
#       HTTP::MemoryCache per network partition key, for the process), determining the HTTP
#       cache partition, selecting a response from and storing one in the memory cache (off
#       unless enabled), the fetch algorithm (Fetching.h's entry point) and populate request
#       from client. Main fetch is in fetching_2, fetch response handover in fetching_3,
#       scheme fetch in fetching_4, HTTP fetch and HTTP-redirect fetch in fetching_5,
#       HTTP-network-or-cache fetch in fetching_6, the network fetch through the
#       ResourceLoader, CORS-preflight fetch and the Fetch metadata headers in fetching_7.
